    Indonesian names for the widgets, matching the terms the app itself uses:
    Zikir, Tasbih, Salat (see lib/i18n/id.i18n.json).

    The folder is values-in, not values-id: Android still resolves Indonesian
    under the language's old ISO code.
-->
